        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Cluster 1 is an SMM with slow magnetic relaxation. χMT at 300 K is 57.97 cm3 K mol−1 (close to four isolated DyIII), decreases to 46.66 cm3 K mol−1 at 20 K, then rises to 54.16 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K, suggesting antiferromagnetic interactions plus a low-T ferromagnetic contribution. M–H does not saturate. Zero-field ac χ″ is frequency-dependent but peakless (QTM); under 0.4 kOe, χ″ peaks appear at 1.8–8.0 K. Orbach+Raman+direct fit gives Ueff = 66.47 cm−1 (93.06 K) and τ0 = 1.53×10−8 s.",
