        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Cluster 2 shows dual-relaxation SMM behavior. χMT at 300 K is 107.22 cm3 K mol−1 (close to eight isolated DyIII) and decreases continuously to 77.70 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K (depopulation plus antiferromagnetic coupling). M–H does not saturate. Under 0.4 kOe, ac χ″ shows two peaks (fast and slow relaxation). Fits give Ueff(FR) = 4.78 cm−1 (4.78 K), τ0 = 5.28×10−3 s; Ueff(SR) = 47.80 cm−1 (66.92 K), τ0 = 5.15×10−8 s, with Raman contributions in both processes.",
